text.en:
The conditional load is the heart of it:

```vhdl
elsif rising_edge(clk) then
    if load = '1' then
        r <= d;
    end if;
end if;
-- q <= r;
```

text.es:
La carga condicional es el corazón del diseño:

```vhdl
elsif rising_edge(clk) then
    if load = '1' then
        r <= d;
    end if;
end if;
-- q <= r;
```
